      371.56
    ],
    "text": "THE MOTOR TRAFFIC ACT (CHAPTER 203)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      384.49,
      539.89,
      408.28
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Transport and Civil Aviation under Section 237 of the Motor Traffic Act (Chapter203) read with Section 128A of the aforesaid Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      423.13,
      539.89,
      471.64
    ],
    "text": "NIMAL SIRIPALA DE SILVA,Minister of Transport and Civil Aviation.Colombo,24th July, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      266.85,
      472.57,
      320.85,
      483.64
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      496.57,
      496.72,
      507.64
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Motor Traffic (Public Service Motor Tricycle) Regulations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      520.57,
      540.03,
      555.64
    ],
    "text": "2. These regulations shall be applicable to every person who obtains a driving license valid for motor tricycleafter these regulations come into operation and uses or adapts to be used or keeps such motor tricycle for the carriage ofpassengers for a fee or reward (hereinafter referred to as \u201cperson to whom these regulations apply\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      568.57,
      539.9,
      603.64
    ],
    "text": "3. No person to whom these regulations apply shall drive a public service motor tricycle, except under specialendorsement on the license endorsed in that behalf by the Commissioner-General of Motor Traffic (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cCommissioner-General\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      616.57,
      428.27,
      627.64
    ],
    "text": "4. Every person who desires to apply for an endoresement under regulation 3 shall -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      108.45,
      640.57,
      499.69,
      651.64
    ],
    "text": "(a) be not less than the age of thirty-five years and not more than the age of seventy years ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      664.57,
      539.82,
      675.64
    ],
    "text": "(b) have at least a period of two years' driving experience after obtaining the driving license for the motor",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      125.85,
      676.57,
      158.26,
      687.64
    ],
    "text": "tricycle",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      723.83,
      310.05,
      742.05
    ],
    "text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4142 \u2014 507 (07/2018)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.37,
      546.71,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2018'07'26PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 26.07.20182A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      103.33,
      547.18,
      126.4
    ],
    "text": "5. Every application for an endorsement under regulation No. 03 shall be made to the Commissioner-Generalsubstantially in the form set out in the Schedule hereto and shall be accompanied by-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.75,
      139.33,
      547.22,
      150.4
    ],
    "text": "(a) a medical certificate issued by the National Transport Medical Institute or any other institution",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.15,
      151.33,
      308.39,
      162.4
    ],
    "text": "authorized by the Commissioner-General ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      175.33,
      547.1,
      186.4
    ],
    "text": "(b) a certificate of a training course designed, approved and conducted by the Commissioner-General or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.15,
      187.33,
      507.61,
      198.4
    ],
    "text": "such training course conducted by an institution authorized by the Commissioner-General ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      211.33,
      490.22,
      222.4
    ],
    "text": "(c) A police report, confirming that the applicant is not an Island Registered Criminal ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      235.33,
      250.74,
      246.4
    ],
    "text": "(d) a fee of rupees two thousand",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      259.33,
      547.24,
      294.4
    ],
    "text": "6. A person to whom these regulations apply shall be disqualified from being a driver of a public service motortricycle if he has been registered as an Island Registered Criminal under the Prevention of Crimes Ordinance (Chapter22).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.15,
      307.33,
      175.17,
      318.4
    ],
    "text": "7. In this regulaiton-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      103.15,
      331.33,
      520.22,
      342.4
    ],
    "text": "\u201cmotor tricyle\u201d shall have the same meaning as specified in the Motor Traffic Act (Chapter 203) ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      103.15,
      355.33,
      547.18,
      366.4
    ],
    "text": "\u201cpublic service motor tricycle\u201d means any motor tricycle used or adapted to be used or kept for the carriage of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      127.15,
      367.33,
      254.36,
      378.4
    ],
    "text": "passengers for a fee or reward.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      275.11,
      391.33,
      327.31,
      402.4
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
